From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 05:40:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let a streaming reader sniff XHTML from a document prefix

is_xhtml_document needs the document up to its root tag, which follows an unbounded prolog, so a reader that streams the page had to hold all of it. is_xhtml_document_prefix answers as soon as no continuation can change the answer: the sniff marks every point where it reads past its input, and returns None while any was reached. is_xhtml_document keeps its answer for complete input.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
---
